[h2]Auto Heal[/h2]
Infantry gradually recover after taking damage. At the default settings, regular units start recovering after 12 seconds and medics after 8. Set either delay independently and change the healing rate with the speed multiplier.

[h2]How to enable it[/h2]
In Eden, place the [b]Auto Heal[/b] module to use it in that scenario. A trigger can turn the module on and off. Enable it without an Eden module through [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=450814997]CBA_A3[/url]. Open [b]Addon Options → Auto Heal[/b], check [b]Enable Auto Heal[/b] and restart the mission. In multiplayer, use the Server tab.

